<h1>Welcome to Pick & Play</h1>
<h3>🎬 Plan the perfect hangout — together.</h3>
<p>Pick & Play makes it easy to choose movies and games with friends, 
    family, or teammates. Create a group session, explore curated 
    entertainment options, and vote on what to do next — all in one place.</p>

<h3>🗳️ How It Works:</h3>
<p>- Create a Group: Admins set up a session for movie night, game time, or any shared activity.</p>

<p>- Suggest & Vote: Members submit their favorite picks and vote on what they want to play or watch.</p>

<p>- Add to the Plan: Once the votes are in, the winning activity is added to the group’s schedule.</p>
